H2 — experience store: DONE

Summary
-------
Implemented `src/learning/harness/experienceStore.ts` from BUILD_SPEC §6.2 and its
colocated suite `src/learning/harness/__tests__/experienceStore.test.ts` (15 tests).
No code was copied from google-research/harness2; the design was rebuilt independently
from the spec. Committed as `446de33` ("H2: experience store"), branch
`khamis1992/h2-h2`.

Spec adaptations required by the real code (docs/re/harness2-H0.md)
------------------------------------------------------------------
- **[U1]** the spec's `embedder.embed(text): Promise<number[]>` does not exist.
  `OllamaEmbedder.embed(texts: string[])` is the batch method and `embedOne(text)`
  (`src/memory/embeddings.ts:48`) is the single-text method. `addLesson` calls
  `embedOne` and swallows failures, so a lesson is still stored when embedding is
  unavailable and `rankLessons` falls back to token overlap.
- **[U7]** the spec's optional redaction regex is replaced by the existing
  `assertNoSecret` (`src/memory/redact.ts:38`), a strict superset. `addLesson`
  catches it and returns `null` (reject, never store) so a background hook cannot
  throw.
- **§8 audit** the `lesson_added` line `{at, kind, lessonId, source, domain}` is
  appended through the existing `appendLearning` (`src/server/learning.ts:29`).
- **`deleteLesson`** returns `false` when the row is gone, so the H8 REST layer can
  map that to 404 without a throw. `setLessonDisabled` returns `null` for a missing
  row for the same reason.

API (all in `src/learning/harness/experienceStore.ts`)
------------------------------------------------------
- `recordCorrection(e)` / `listCorrections({taskId?, domain?})` — events clipped to
  4000 chars, stored under the `corrections` entity kind.
- `addLesson({agentId, domain, source, sourceRef, d, embedder?})` → `Lesson | null`.
  Rejects incomplete lessons (`isCompleteLesson`), secret-looking text, and
  duplicates (case-insensitive `lesson` match returns the stored lesson). Stores a
  normalized base64 vector + `dim` when an embedder is supplied, prunes the domain,
  and appends the audit line.
- `listLessons({agentId?, domain?, includeDisabled?})` — agent-scoped but always
  includes global (`agentId === null`) lessons, newest first.
- `deleteLesson(id)`, `setLessonDisabled(id, disabled)`, `markUsed(ids)`.
- `rankLessons(candidates, {text, vector?}, k = 5, minScore = 0.35)` — cosine when
  both vectors exist, else token-overlap cosine; returns the top-k at or above
  `minScore`.
- `MAX_LESSONS_PER_DOMAIN = 50`; pruning drops low-confidence, never-used entries
  first.

Acceptance (BUILD_SPEC §11 H2 row) — every item is covered by a passing test
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
| Acceptance item | Test |
|---|---|
| `LOAM_DATA_DIR` = tmp, add → list returns 1 | "add -> list returns exactly that lesson" |
| duplicate lesson not re-added | "does not re-add a duplicate lesson" (second add returns the stored id, list stays 1) |
| 51st lesson prunes to 50 | "prunes a domain to MAX_LESSONS_PER_DOMAIN, dropping low-confidence first" (51 adds → 50, the 3 high-confidence ones survive) |
| delete → 404 on next get | "delete -> the lesson is gone and the next get returns 404" (second delete returns false) |

Additional coverage: vector stored with `dim === 32`; embedding failure still stores
the lesson; incomplete lesson rejected; secret-like lesson rejected; agent scoping
with global fallback; disabled flag hides/shows; `markUsed` increments `uses` and
stamps `lastUsedAt`; correction clipping to 4000 chars; lexical ranking; cosine
ranking.

No agent/system instruction was changed. Nothing instruction-related is created, so
there is no proposal and no approval to wait for (H6 owns that flow).

